OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA cloudy
OL,6,Fnight, with outbreaks of rain
OL,7,Faffecting many areas this evening,
OL,8,Fturning to snow over high ground. The
OL,9,Frain gradually retreats westwards
OL,10,Fovernight. Feeling cold, with
OL,11,Ftemperatures widely in single figures
OL,12,Fand frost likely over high ground.
OL,13,
OL,14,CWednesday:FA cold, grey morning with
OL,15,Ffrost over high ground. Cloudy through
OL,16,Fthe afternoon, remaining cold inland,
OL,17,Fbut milder and breezier along the
OL,18,Fcoast, with showers developing by
OL,19,Fevening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
