OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FCloudy but dry on Thursday. A wet
OL,7,Fstart to Friday, with rain, or snow
OL,8,Fover high ground, gradually clearing.
OL,9,FFeeling cold, with cloudy periods on
OL,10,FSaturday. Temperatures generally below
OL,11,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
